OL,3,GNEWSAFormer shoplifter ran
OL,4,A'steal-to-order' Whatsapp group
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former shoplifter said she used to
OL,7,Frun a Whatsapp group with about 200
OL,8,Fpeople asking for things they wanted
OL,9,Fher to steal.
OL,11,FKeeley Knowles stole up to #7,000 worth
OL,12,Fof designer goods every day and became
OL,13,Fknown as "Birmingham's most prolific
OL,14,Fshoplifter".
OL,16,FThe 43-year-old said she always knew
OL,17,Fwhat she was doing was wrong, but
OL,18,Fneeded the money to fund her heroin
OL,19,Faddiction.
